WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:03,180
Wooden boat, you can figure it out

2
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,180
You guys usually take care of you, right?

3
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:07,180
Look, a large part of the house in Zuoer Yeli Village collapsed.

4
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:08,180
The folks really have no place to go.

5
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:10,180
Your igloo is very well built.

6
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,180
It must be spacious inside

7
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:13,180
How about you let everyone come in and stay for a few days?

8
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:14,180
We'll leave when the snow stops

9
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:17,180
I will never take advantage of you in vain. Don’t walk.

10
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,370
They are all from the countryside.

11
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:25,900
You can die without saving me

12
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:28,340
What's so great

13
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:29,340
Isn't it just a pile of broken snow?

14
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:31,340
You really think you are some kind of magic weapon.

15
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:33,340
We don't care about your dog house

16
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:34,340
This guy can dig

17
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:35,660
We can dig too

18
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:41,100
Folks, this newly built igloo is not easy to walk around.

19
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,650
Dig it yourself

20
00:00:42,650 --> 00:00:44,770
Go without asking him

21
00:00:44,770 --> 00:00:49,230
Can't compare to him alone
